@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Розгортання Rehab з бюджетом 0 грн
node "Browser\niPhone Safari for mobile acceptance" as Browser
node "Render Static Site\nExpo Web / dist / SPA rewrite" as Web
node "Render Web Service Free\nPython 3.12 / FastAPI / uvicorn" as API
database "Neon Free\nPostgreSQL" as DB
node "GitHub Actions\nreminder schedule on default branch" as Actions
cloud "Gmail API" as Gmail
Browser --> Web : HTTPS
Browser --> API : HTTPS / JSON / JWT
API --> DB : psycopg / TLS
Actions --> API : POST /internal/jobs/reminders\nX-Job-Token
API --> Gmail : OAuth / opt-in reminders
note bottom of API
 Secrets only in service settings.
 Alembic migrations run under controlled local setup before API release.
 Local dev/test PostgreSQL instances are separate from Neon.
end note
@enduml
